# Item T flip-flop: two hoppers facing each other (east/west), both locked by a torch under each; one item. Each 2 gt lever pulse on both torch supports unlocks both for 2 gt: the holder pushes its item (8 gt cooldown), the receiver gets cooldown 7 (wasEmpty, ticked after the sender) and cannot push back before the hoppers relock. A comparator reading the west hopper drives a lamp: on, off, on, off.
box -3 -1 -2 3 3 2
block -2 0 0 minecraft:stone
block -1 0 0 minecraft:stone
block 0 0 0 minecraft:stone
block 1 0 0 minecraft:stone
block -1 1 0 minecraft:stone
block 0 1 0 minecraft:redstone_torch[lit=true]
block 1 1 0 minecraft:redstone_torch[lit=true]
block 0 2 0 minecraft:hopper[enabled=false,facing=east]
block 1 2 0 minecraft:hopper[enabled=false,facing=west]
block -1 2 0 minecraft:comparator[facing=east,mode=compare,powered=false]
block -2 1 0 minecraft:stone
block -2 2 0 minecraft:redstone_lamp[lit=false]
block 0 0 -1 minecraft:lever[face=wall,facing=north,powered=false]
block 1 0 -1 minecraft:lever[face=wall,facing=north,powered=false]
item 0 2 0 0 stone 1
run 20
